# Secrets and Vercel CLI

**Doppler** (`pavilion` / `dev`) holds agent ops secrets (`VERCEL_TOKEN`, `VERCEL_ORG_ID`).  
**Vercel dashboard** holds Pavilion production runtime env.

Local `.env` is **bootstrap only**: `DOPPLER_TOKEN`. Never commit `.env`.

Before any `vercel` command:

```bash
./scripts/doppler_run.sh vercel … --scope robert-4220s-projects
```

Never treasurer / Stone Hill www. Stone Hill ships from `~/shmspto` via git push only.

`~/hskrg-work` uses the same Doppler project (`pavilion` / `dev`).
